[38;2;124;124;124mThe Mertens conjecture (that |M(n)| < sqrt(n) for all n > 1) was disproved by [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mOdlyzko and te Riele in 1985. This is stronger than RH. RH is equivalent to M(n)[0m[38;2;124;124;124m= O(n^{1/2+ε}).[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThe assumption that M(n) follows a normal distribution N(0, σ²n) would suggest [0m
